    "text": "<p>The graph shows how the magnification <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> produced by a thin lens varies with image distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>. The focal length of the lens used is</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0179_79f30e00837c.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 239px;\" /></p>"
